Package: transforEmotion
Title: Transformer Emotion Analysis for Text, Image, Video, and Speech
Version: 0.1.9
Date: 2026-10-26
Author: Alexander Christensen [aut] (<https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9798-7037>),
    Hudson Golino [aut] (<https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1601-1447>),
    Aleksandar Tomašević [aut, cre] (<https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4863-6051>)
