Maintainer: Aleksandar Tomašević <atomashevic@gmail.com>
Description: Zero-shot emotion classification for text, images, video and
    speech, and tools to find faces and code them by hand. Text is scored
    with 'Hugging Face' transformer pipelines (default
    'cross-encoder/nli-distilroberta-base'). Images and video are scored
    with 'OpenAI CLIP'; faces can be limited to those found by 'OpenCV
    YuNet'. Speech segments are scored with 'LAION CLAP'. Frame scores can
    be calibrated and combined into posteriors, and detected faces or other
    items can be turned into a local coding task served from R. Any other
    zero-shot model can be selected by its name on
    <https://huggingface.co/models>. For details see Tomašević, Golino, and
    Christensen (2026) <doi:10.5117/CCR2026.2.2.TOMA>.
